[I] Bare libuv bindings for lua

[T] luv provides bare libuv bindings for LuaJIT and Lua 5.1 to 5.4, making
[T] the libuv event loop, timers, sockets, processes and file system APIs
[T] available to Lua scripts. It was made for luvit and is used by Neovim.

[U] https://github.com/luvit/luv

[A] Libluv Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base

[V] 1.53.0-0
[L] APL

[D] a389daff47a6ed2a04eb746f8d2c5f3a39aa9c592ebc2d73695bebff luv-1.53.0-0.tar.gz https://github.com/luvit/luv/releases/download/1.53.0-0/

var_append cmakeopt ' ' '-DWITH_SHARED_LIBUV=ON -DLUA_BUILD_TYPE=System -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON'
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DSHAREDLIBS_INSTALL_LIB_DIR=$libdir
pkginstalled luajit || var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DWITH_LUA_ENGINE=Lua
